		{
			dependencies: ["774B1D4152A0B4ED"]
			description: [
				"要推进 &eImmersive Engineering&r 的进程，你需要建造的第一台&o&b重要&r机器就是 &3Coke Oven&r。"
				""
				"使用&3焦炭砖&r制作。要建造一个&3焦炭炉&r，请将&o&b27&r个此方块排列成一个&o&b3x3x3&r的实心立方体，然后用&6工程师之锤&r&a右键&r点击&o&b其中一个面的中心方块&r。"
				""
				"The Coke Oven is easy to use; putting &8Coal&r (or a &8Block of Coal&r) in the &nleft slot&r in the &o&bGUI&r will &astart&r it. After about &o&b50&r seconds, that &8Coal&r will produce &o&b1&r &3Coal Coke&r and &o&b500&r mB of &dCreosote Oil&r. The &8Block of Coal&r, it will take about &o&b450&r seconds and produce &o&b1&r &3Block of Coal Coke&r and &o&b5,000&r mB of &dCreosote Oil&r, making it more efficient."
				""
				"木块也可以在&a焦炭炉&r中使用。大约经过&o&b45&r秒后，这些&a木材&r将产生一个&8木炭&r和&o&b250&r mB的&d焦油油&r。"
				""
				"物品可通过&6漏斗&r或类似的&o&b运输&r方块自动放入&3炼焦炉&r的&n顶部&r、&n底部&r或&n侧面&r。"
				""
				"要从&d焦炉&r中移除&dCreosote Oil&r，将空的便携式&o&b流体容器&r放在右上角的槽位中，即可将其填充为&o&b1,000&r mB的&dCreosote Oil&r，然后将装满的容器移至&o&bGUI&r的右下角槽位。"
				""
				"To automatically remove &dCreosote Oil&r, a &ePump&r can be used and placed directly against the &3Coke Oven&r. The side of the &ePump&r facing away from the &3Coke Oven&r can be &o&bhammered&r with an &6Engineer's Hammer&r to &coutput&r and &b&ohammered&r while &asneaking&r to configure the (inaccessible) opposite side to accept &9input&r. The &ePump&r does need to be &cpowered&r and requires a &cRedstone&r signal."
			]
			icon: "immersiveengineering:coke_oven"
			id: "0DA972D85BB3C86C"
