		{
			dependencies: ["0DA972D85BB3C86C"]
			description: [
				"The &4Crude Blast Furnace&r is used to increase the &8Carbon&r contents in &7Iron&r, turning it into &3Steel&r. To achieve this, only pure, &o&bhigh-carbon fuels&r may be used for the furnace, specifically &3Coal Coke&r and &8Charcoal&r. This operation takes &o&b60&r seconds per ingot. One &3Coal Coke&r burns long enough to smelt one ingot, which produces one &eSlag&r piece. A &3Block of Coal Coke&r smelts &o&b10&r ingots (so it's &o&b11.11&r% more fuel efficient). A &7Block of Iron&r smelts in less time than &o&b9&r single pieces."
				""
				"除了 &3钢&r，熔炉还会产生 &e炉渣&r，必须将其清除，否则熔炉将停止工作。虽然从技术上讲它是一种 &8废料&r，但有多种方法可以 &o&b回收&r 它。"
				""
				"要建造一个&4高炉&r，将&o&b27&r个&4高炉砖&r排列成一个&o&b3x3x3&r的立方体，然后用&6工程师之锤&r&a右键&r &o&b其中一个面的中心方块&r。"
				""
				"The &4Crude Blast Furnace&r is not automateable. All in- and &coutputs&r must be arranged manually through its &o&bGUI&r. If you want to &o&bautomate&r the creation of &3Steel&r, you should probably look into creating an &2Improved Blast Furnace&r. &aHoppers&r, &cConveyor Belts&r and other item transporters &o&bcan't&r hook up to the &4Crude Blast Furnace&r, but they can with the &2Improved Blast Furnace&r."
			]
			icon: "immersiveengineering:blast_furnace"
			id: "449C41A3AFBBE8E9"
			min_width: 500
			rewards: [{
				id: "67BD2D99C4EBAF93"
