		{
			dependencies: ["449C41A3AFBBE8E9"]
			description: [
				"&d合金熔炉&r是一种由耐热砂岩和砖块制成的&o&b简易熔炉&r。"
				""
				"在这里，温度&n足够高&r，可以将金属&o&b熔化成液态&r并进行混合，从而创造出&o&b合金&r。"
				""
				"这样无需繁琐地混合粉尘，就能制作出像&eElectrum&r和&aConstantan&r这样的&n重要合金&r。"
				""
				"To form the &dAlloy Kiln&r, arrange &o&b8&r of the &o&bKiln Bricks&r in a &o&b2x2x2&r cube, and &eRight-click&r one of the sides' blocks with an &6Engineer's Hammer&r."
			]
